		}
		{
			dependencies: ["386B4A8A0B37927E"]
			description: ["Cool a zirconium alloy too fast to crystallise and it is a glass that behaves like a spring. A flexspline cast from it makes a &6Strain Wave Gear&r with no backlash."]
