		{
			dependencies: ["1BE7613A33089960"]
			description: ["A terbium plasma gives light at a wavelength nobody built a scanner for before. The &6BEUV Scanner&r exposes a wafer and the driver ASIC comes out of it. The debris is caught and recycled."]
