		{
			dependencies: ["5EA79DAD9574D598"]
			description: ["A scanning tip peels hydrogen off a silicon surface one atom at a time, and phosphine fills the holes. The &6STM Lithography Cell&r writes a &6P:Si Die&r. It has to be cold before it works."]
