		{
			dependencies: ["17C0F46C21B9CD13"]
			description: ["A computer built in shells, in nine times Earth's sunlight, running logic that barely makes heat. The &6Matrioshka Computer&r is where UIV research is written, and its logic tiles are among the longest things to build here."]
