		{
			dependencies: ["7E2EF99503F9DB02"]
			description: ["Heat has nowhere to go in space but out. A sheet of liquid tin droplets falling in free fall carries it away, which only works in orbit. The &6Droplet Radiator Works&r makes the modules and the TPV tiles."]
