		{
			dependencies: ["5FA8F7F32C81B302"]
			description: ["Pulse profiles from a pulsar go into the Matrioshka, and the &6Neutron Star EOS Chart&r comes out. It tells you how hard a star pushes back. The computer decides on a long run."]
