		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3B397C1EFE90548C"]
			description: ["Cool the drip neutrons into a superfluid and shut it in a cage. The &6Neutronium Pellet&r is fiction: a spoonful of neutron matter held at ordinary pressure by a field. It is not the neutronium of the other mods."]
			icon: "gtceu:neutronium_cage"
