		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3B397C1EFE90548C"]
			description: ["Decompress a bit of crust and the heavy elements are born, as in a kilonova. A uranium target hit by the same neutrons gives einsteinium and fermium, and from them the &6Element 119 Recoil&r and &6Census II&r."]
