		{
			dependencies: ["1993F92869A4278F"]
			description: ["Fresh r-process matter keeps on decaying and giving off heat. The &6Decay Heat Vault&r burns a sealed kilonova capsule for power, and the ash goes back to the platinum plant. Its power is local to the site."]
			icon: "gtceu:decay_heat_vault"
